        <activityName xml:lang="en">Aluminiumtrihydroxide-acrylic glass, production mix, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Aluminiumtrihydroxide-acrylic glass, production mix, at plant
Production shares of the individual countries from DuPont Building Materials.;
UUID: 185229b6-5c68-303c-84f0-8c82a5f54bca
This data set includes the production of aluminiumtrihydroxide-acrylic glass in the USA, Turkey, South Korea and Japan based on estimated shares in global production. Transport from the production facilities to Switzerland is included.
Location: Data valid for Switzerland
Technology: Average production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_185229b6-5c68-303c-84f0-8c82a5f54bca.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
